{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02718","headline":"巫山高 · 阎立本","name":"巫山高","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见巫山高高半天起，绝壁千寻尽相似。\n君不见巫山磕匝翠屏开，湘江碧水遶山来。\n绿树春娇明月峡，红花朝覆白云台。\n台上朝云无定所，此中窕窈神仙女。\n仙女盈盈仙骨飞，清容出没有光辉。\n欲暮高唐行雨送，今宵定入荆王梦。\n荆王梦里爱穠华，枕席初开红帐遮。\n可怜欲晓啼猨处，说道巫山是妾家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎立本","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02718.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02718","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}